</section>
<section id="A6" class="ltx_appendix">
<h2 class="ltx_title ltx_title_appendix"><span class="ltx_tag ltx_tag_appendix">Appendix F </span>Evaluation Metrics</h2>

<figure id="A6.T8" class="ltx_table">
